春夏秋冬 感じるんだ 呼んでるんだ あ ソレソレソレソレ
Feel the four seasons, they're calling out to us, ah sore sore sore sore!

148
00:16:54,533 --> 00:16:57,933
シェイプシェイプシェイプ 胸を張っては 汗たらり
Shape shape shape, stand tall with chest out, sweat dripping down

149
00:16:57,933 --> 00:17:00,933
突っ走っても こっちこっちこっち 逆方向
Dash forward, but over here, over here, going in the wrong direction!

150
00:17:00,933 --> 00:17:02,433
青春はそれでいいのだ
That's what youth is all about!

151
00:17:02,433 --> 00:17:04,933
勘違いも味方にしちゃうのだ
Even misunderstandings become our allies!

152
00:17:04,933 --> 00:17:09,633
森羅万象 歌え日本 踊れ日本 あ ソレソレソレ（よいしょ！）
All creation, sing Japan, dance Japan, ah sore sore sore (Yoisho!)

153
00:17:09,633 --> 00:17:13,933
ちんとんしゃんしゃんと どこまでも ほらパワフル全開で突き抜けろ
Chin ton shan shan, wherever you go, power through with full blast!

154
00:17:13,933 --> 00:17:17,933
あっちもこっちもそっちも 祭りだ わっしょい あっぱれあっぱれアドベンチャー
Over there, over here, over where, it's a festival! Wasshoi! Splendid, splendid adventure!

155
00:17:17,933 --> 00:17:19,633
大和の国へ 摩訶不思議な言霊（OK!）
To the land of Yamato, mysterious power of words (OK!)

156
00:17:19,633 --> 00:17:23,933
奇想天外さ いつまでも（さいさい！） 神様 仏様 兎様
Bizarre and wild forever and ever! (Sai sai!) Gods, Buddha, Rabbits!

157
00:17:23,933 --> 00:17:25,733
月に祈って拝んで君思って
Praying to the moon, worshiping, thinking of you,

158
00:17:25,733 --> 00:17:27,433
半端な気持ちを断ち切って
severing all half-hearted feelings!

159
00:17:27,433 --> 00:17:32,633
とりあえずいいか？ 黙ってついてこい follow me
For now, are you ready? Shut up and follow me!

160
00:17:32,633 --> 00:17:36,133
嗚呼 嗚呼
Ah, ah

161
00:17:36,133 --> 00:17:41,133
君の未来を明るく照らすなんて お茶の子さいさいさい
Brightening up your future is a total piece of cake!

162
00:17:54,933 --> 00:18:00,933
百花繚乱 大和撫子たちよ どでかい花火を上げましょうね
A profusion of flowers, Yamato Nadeshiko, let's set off huge fireworks!

163
00:18:00,933 --> 00:18:07,633
ほら踊る阿呆に見る阿呆 同じ阿呆なら踊らニャ損損
Look, fools dancing and fools watching, if we're both fools, it's a loss not to dance!

164
00:18:07,633 --> 00:18:10,933
さあみんな ダンスダンスダンス さらし巻いておへそちらり
Come on everyone, dance dance dance, wrapped in sarashi, belly button peeking through

165
00:18:10,933 --> 00:18:14,433
靴脱いだら ソックソックソック 破れてる
Take off your shoes, socks, socks, socks are torn!

166
00:18:14,433 --> 00:18:16,633
どったんばったんなこのステージ
This hectic, chaotic stage,

167
00:18:16,633 --> 00:18:19,633
それが私にとっての正義（ジャスティス！）
that's my kind of justice! (Justice!)

168
00:18:19,633 --> 00:18:24,433
古今東西 羽ばたくんだ 聞こえるんだ あ ソレソレソレソレ
All times and places, flap your wings, I can hear it, ah sore sore sore sore!

169
00:18:24,433 --> 00:18:27,933
シェイクシェイクシェイク 腕を振っては 涙キラリ
Shake shake shake, wave your arms, tears glistening

170
00:18:27,933 --> 00:18:30,933
強がっても きゅんきゅんきゅん 苦しいの
Even pretending to be tough, my heart throbs with pain

171
00:18:30,933 --> 00:18:32,433
乙女はそれでいいのだ
That's fine for a maiden!

172
00:18:32,433 --> 00:18:34,933
マイナスも味方にしちゃうのだ
We even turn negatives into our strength!

173
00:18:34,933 --> 00:18:39,633
情意投合 愛してんんだ みんな大好きだ だだだだだ
Mutual understanding, I love you, I love you all so so so much!

174
00:18:50,133 --> 00:18:54,433
ちんとんしゃんしゃんと どこまでも（はいはい！）
Chin ton shan shan, wherever you go (Hai hai!)

175
00:18:54,433 --> 00:18:57,633
ほらパワフル全開で突き抜けろ
Power through with full blast!

176
00:18:57,633 --> 00:19:00,933
あっちもこっちもそっちも 祭りだ わっしょい あっぱれあっぱれアドベンチャー
Over there, over here, over where, it's a festival! Wasshoi! Splendid, splendid adventure!

177
00:19:00,933 --> 00:19:04,633
大和の国へ 摩訶不思議な言霊（それそれそれそれ！）
To the land of Yamato, mysterious power of words (Sore sore sore sore!)

178
00:19:04,633 --> 00:19:07,933
奇想天外さ いつまでも（ガッテン！） 神様 仏様 兎様
Bizarre and wild forever and ever! (Got it!) Gods, Buddha, Rabbits!

179
00:19:07,933 --> 00:19:09,633
月に祈って拝んで君思って
Praying to the moon, worshiping, thinking of you,

180
00:19:09,633 --> 00:19:11,333
半端な気持ちを断ち切って
severing all half-hearted feelings!

181
00:19:11,333 --> 00:19:16,633
とりあえずいいか？ 黙ってついてこい follow me
For now, are you ready? Shut up and follow me!

182
00:19:16,633 --> 00:19:20,133
嗚呼 嗚呼
Ah, ah

183
00:19:20,133 --> 00:19:27,633
君の未来を明るく照らすなんて お茶の子さいさいさい
Brightening up your future is a total piece of cake!

184
00:19:29,133 --> 00:19:33,433
満月の下で踊りましょう
Let's dance under the full moon

185
00:19:33,433 --> 00:19:36,933
桜舞い散る季節と歌いましょう
Let's sing with the season of fluttering cherry blossoms

186
00:19:36,933 --> 00:19:40,933
君といつかまた出会うその日まで
Until the day we meet again somewhere

187
00:19:40,933 --> 00:19:44,133
だから意地っぱりさんも 照れ屋さんもしゃお屋さんも あなたも
So stubborn ones, shy ones, greengrocers, and you too

188
00:19:44,133 --> 00:19:48,133
忘れないで ばいばいさようなら（ばいばーい！）
Don't forget, bye-bye, farewell! (Bye-bye!)

189
00:20:09,273 --> 00:20:12,773
逃げない!!
Don't Run Away!!

190
00:20:13,273 --> 00:20:19,273
時間たてば 事務的にやってくる
As time passes, it comes around automatically

191
00:20:20,273 --> 00:20:26,773
明日なんて 我々の明日じゃない
A tomorrow like that isn't our tomorrow

192
00:20:27,473 --> 00:20:30,473
逃げたい
I want to run away...

193
00:20:30,473 --> 00:20:34,073
じゃあどこに逃げればいいのかな
...then where should I run to?

194
00:20:34,473 --> 00:20:37,973
曖昧な場所では
In an ambiguous place,

195
00:20:38,273 --> 00:20:41,273
何にも変われない
nothing can ever change.

196
00:20:41,773 --> 00:20:48,773
立ち向かえとか やり直せるよとか 間違った道を
Telling me to face it or that I can start over on a mistaken path...

197
00:20:49,073 --> 00:20:52,073
何度もやり直せる
...saying I can restart again and again,

198
00:20:52,273 --> 00:20:55,773
あなた一体 誰ですか？
who on earth are you?

199
00:20:56,273 --> 00:21:03,073
論点ずれてる人たち なんて押しのけて
Pushing aside those people who miss the point entirely,

200
00:21:03,273 --> 00:21:07,273
自分の道 作らなくちゃ
I have to forge my own path.

201
00:21:10,273 --> 00:21:17,073
“失敗しない”なんて 契約を人は 誰とも結んではいない
No one has ever made a contract promising 'I won't fail.'

202
00:21:17,273 --> 00:21:26,773
“幸せになります”とは誓いいつか 昔大事な人と 約束したはずだ
I must have promised an important person long ago that 'I will be happy.'

203
00:21:27,473 --> 00:21:34,473
大人になるために 早く忘れることだけ覚え
To become an adult, learning only how to forget quickly,

204
00:21:35,073 --> 00:21:37,973
無理に目を背けたら
if you forcibly avert your eyes,

205
00:21:38,173 --> 00:21:41,773
10年後の子供を 救えないよ
you won't be able to save the child ten years from now.

206
00:21:42,073 --> 00:21:48,773
全部自分が悪いと 責める君に伝えたい
I want to tell you, who blame yourself for everything,

207
00:21:49,073 --> 00:21:56,073
同じ言葉を人に 言わない君を 誰責められない
no one can blame you for not saying those same words to others.

208
00:21:56,473 --> 00:21:58,473
逃げない
I won't run away.

209
00:21:58,473 --> 00:22:02,773
じゃあどこに向かえばいいのかな
Then where should I head toward?

210
00:22:03,273 --> 00:22:09,773
辛さの根源を 見つめ直せる場所
A place where I can re-examine the root of my pain.

211
00:22:10,473 --> 00:22:15,773
いきなり 空を飛ぶ 方法なんて
A way to suddenly fly in the sky—

212
00:22:16,073 --> 00:22:17,773
知らない
I don't know one.

213
00:22:18,073 --> 00:22:22,773
悪と暇の 行き来は 誰もしないで！
Don't go back and forth between evil and boredom!

214
00:22:24,773 --> 00:22:29,473
“生きろ”とか“甦れ”とか もういい
'Live on' or 'Be revived,' enough already!

215
00:22:29,773 --> 00:22:35,073
逆に逃げて もういいんだよとかいう
Telling me 'It's okay to run away instead'...

216
00:22:35,273 --> 00:22:38,473
私は一体 誰ですか？
...who on earth am I?

217
00:22:39,073 --> 00:22:45,773
分かってくれている 瞳の輝きが
There are people whose shining eyes show they understand,

218
00:22:46,073 --> 00:22:53,073
消えてないって 証明してくれた 人たちがいる
proving to me that it hasn't faded away.

219
00:23:07,273 --> 00:23:13,473
時間たてば 事務的にやってくる
As time passes, it comes around automatically

220
00:23:14,273 --> 00:23:20,773
明日なんて 我々の明日じゃない
A tomorrow like that isn't our tomorrow

221
00:23:22,773 --> 00:23:26,773
足に訊ねる 走れるか
Asking my feet: can you run?

222
00:23:27,073 --> 00:23:29,773
指に訊ねる 開ける？
Asking my fingers: can you open?

223
00:23:30,073 --> 00:23:36,773
体温に訊ねる 血潮で導いて いけるだろうか
Asking my body temperature: can my surging blood lead the way?

224
00:23:37,073 --> 00:23:43,773
始まりの合図は他の 誰にも決めさせたくない
I won't let anyone else decide the signal to start.

225
00:23:44,073 --> 00:23:47,773
教科書の先の現代は
The present era beyond the textbooks—

226
00:23:48,073 --> 00:23:52,273
我々が作っていくから
—is something we will create ourselves.

227
00:23:52,773 --> 00:23:55,773
だから逃げない
So I won't run away.

228
00:23:56,073 --> 00:24:00,073
私（みんな）は逃げない
We won't run away.

229
00:24:00,273 --> 00:24:03,473
逃げたい君を
I won't leave behind

230
00:24:03,773 --> 00:24:06,773
置いては行かない
you, who want to run.

231
00:24:07,073 --> 00:24:10,773
じゃなきゃ意味ない
Otherwise, it would be meaningless.

232
00:24:11,073 --> 00:24:13,773
手放したいことない
There's nothing I want to let go of.

233
00:24:14,073 --> 00:24:19,773
顔を見なくなって 君を知ってる
Even without seeing your face, I know you.

234
00:24:20,073 --> 00:24:23,773
苦しめる 渦の中
In the midst of the tormenting vortex,

235
00:24:24,073 --> 00:24:27,073
頭脳の目 広げて
open the eyes of your mind,

236
00:24:27,173 --> 00:24:30,473
別の角度で 見てごらん
and try looking from a different angle.

237
00:24:30,773 --> 00:24:34,073
そこだけ 逃げないで
Just don't run away from that.

238
00:24:34,273 --> 00:24:40,473
時間たてば 事務的にやってくる
As time passes, it comes around automatically

239
00:24:41,273 --> 00:24:47,773
明日なんて 我々の明日じゃない
A tomorrow like that isn't our tomorrow

240
00:24:59,773 --> 00:25:01,573
「とくベチュ、して」
"Give me special kisses"

241
00:25:02,321 --> 00:25:05,521
Oh baby "I love you" じゃ足りない
Oh baby, "I love you" isn't enough

242
00:25:05,521 --> 00:25:08,321
一番大事がいい
I want to be what matters to you most

243
00:25:08,321 --> 00:25:12,121
君が作るオリジナルの
With the original kind of love...

244
00:25:12,121 --> 00:25:15,821
特別、チューして。
...that you create, give me a special kiss.

245
00:25:17,321 --> 00:25:20,321
眩しくて 目が覚めて
The light is so bright as I wake up,

246
00:25:20,321 --> 00:25:23,321
愛おしく思ってよ
Please hold me dear to your heart.

247
00:25:23,321 --> 00:25:30,021
眠り姫のように 優しく口付けて
Kiss me gently like Sleeping Beauty.

248
00:25:30,021 --> 00:25:33,121
ゴミめいた この世界
In this world full of trash,

249
00:25:33,121 --> 00:25:36,521
ピュアがかかる 君がいる
You are here, so pure and bright.

250
00:25:36,521 --> 00:25:43,121
全てに触れずに 2人だけでいよう
Let's leave everything else untouched and be just the two of us.

251
00:25:43,121 --> 00:25:46,021
私のこと 独占して
Keep me all to yourself,

252
00:25:46,021 --> 00:25:49,321
君だけのモノになってもいい
I wouldn't mind belonging only to you.

253
00:25:49,321 --> 00:25:56,921
なんでもある日の 「なんでもない」 気付いてね
On an ordinary day, please notice when I say "it's nothing."

254
00:25:56,921 --> 00:26:01,121
Oh baby "I love you" じゃ足りない
Oh baby, "I love you" isn't enough,

255
00:26:01,121 --> 00:26:04,121
君の 「特別」 にして
Make me your "special one."

256
00:26:04,121 --> 00:26:07,421
ねぇ もっと Give me a kiss もう私は
Hey, give me a kiss, I'm already...

257
00:26:07,421 --> 00:26:10,521
君でいっぱいよ
...so completely full of you.

258
00:26:10,521 --> 00:26:14,121
ほどけない リボン結び
An untieable ribbon knot,

259
00:26:14,121 --> 00:26:17,121
小指 キュッて縛って
Tie our pinky fingers tight together.

260
00:26:17,121 --> 00:26:20,321
そうよ 一生 一緒がいいもん
That's right, I want us to be together for life,

261
00:26:20,321 --> 00:26:24,121
とくべチュが欲しい
I want a special kiss from you.

262
00:26:32,121 --> 00:26:35,321
2人きり 週末は
Just the two of us on the weekend,

263
00:26:35,321 --> 00:26:38,721
奏でてよ ハーモニー
Play a sweet harmony for us.

264
00:26:38,721 --> 00:26:45,321
流れ星見たら 私を想ってほしい
If you see a shooting star, I want you to think of me.

265
00:26:45,321 --> 00:26:48,521
あまあまな君なのに
You're usually so sweet to me,

266
00:26:48,521 --> 00:26:51,821
広い街 呑み込まれ
But swallowed up by the big city,

267
00:26:51,821 --> 00:26:58,421
戦う姿に 大きいはなまるだね
Seeing you fight hard deserves a giant gold star!

268
00:26:58,421 --> 00:27:01,521
好きなところ、優しいとこ。
What I like about you is how gentle you are.

269
00:27:01,521 --> 00:27:05,121
嫌いなとこも、優しいとこ。
What I dislike about you is also how gentle you are.

270
00:27:05,121 --> 00:27:07,821
誰にもあげない
I won't give you to anyone else,

271
00:27:07,821 --> 00:27:11,821
私だけ 独り占め!
I'm keeping you all to myself!

272
00:27:11,821 --> 00:27:15,921
う〜 だって 今までの人と
Ooh, because someone just like everyone before...

273
00:27:15,921 --> 00:27:19,121
同じはいらないんです
...is not what I need.

274
00:27:19,121 --> 00:27:22,321
ねぇ もっと Give me more love 私のため
Hey, give me more love, I want you to live...

275
00:27:22,321 --> 00:27:25,521
生きてほしいんです
...just for my sake.

276
00:27:25,521 --> 00:27:28,821
だから ウサギと私は
That's why, just like a rabbit,

277
00:27:28,821 --> 00:27:32,121
さみしくさせないで
don't leave me feeling lonely.

278
00:27:32,121 --> 00:27:35,521
そんなんじゃ束縛じゃないわ
That's not even possessive at all,

279
00:27:35,521 --> 00:27:38,821
苦しいのが好き
I actually love feeling bound.

280
00:27:38,821 --> 00:27:45,321
ショートケーキ イチゴみたいに 座ってもいい?
Can I sit on top like the strawberry on a strawberry shortcake?

281
00:27:45,321 --> 00:27:48,521
赤く甘い恋だもん
Because this is a red, sweet love.

282
00:27:48,521 --> 00:27:51,921
誰かにあげた 大好きも
Even the love you gave to someone else before,

283
00:27:51,921 --> 00:27:56,121
返してもらって全部私に ちょーだい
get it back and give it all to me!

284
00:27:56,121 --> 00:28:02,121
もっと!
Give me more!

285
00:28:02,121 --> 00:28:06,521
君は神様が作る
You are a miracle of a person...

286
00:28:06,521 --> 00:28:09,321
奇跡のようなヒト
...created by God Himself.

287
00:28:09,321 --> 00:28:13,321
拗ねた顔も その寝顔も
Your pouting face, your sleeping face too,

288
00:28:13,321 --> 00:28:17,521
守ってあげるね
I will protect them all for you.

289
00:28:17,521 --> 00:28:21,121
Oh baby "I love you" じゃ足りない
Oh baby, "I love you" isn't enough,

290
00:28:21,121 --> 00:28:24,321
君の 「特別」 にして
Make me your "special one."

291
00:28:24,321 --> 00:28:27,521
ねぇ もっと Give me a kiss もう私は
Hey, give me a kiss, I'm already...

292
00:28:27,521 --> 00:28:30,821
君でいっぱいよ
...so completely full of you.

293
00:28:30,821 --> 00:28:34,121
ほどけない リボン結び
An untieable ribbon knot,

294
00:28:34,121 --> 00:28:37,321
小指 キュッて縛って
Tie our pinky fingers tight together.

295
00:28:37,321 --> 00:28:40,521
ねぇ baby 最初で最後の
Hey baby, make it our first and last...

296
00:28:40,521 --> 00:28:43,821
とくべチュにしてね
...special kiss, okay?

297
00:29:04,321 --> 00:29:06,021
ミルクで乾杯〜
Cheers with milk!

298
00:29:06,021 --> 00:29:07,521
砂糖盛ったら甘〜い
Add lots of sugar and it's so sweet!

299
00:29:07,521 --> 00:29:09,321
レンジでちんしてあったか〜い
Microwave it up and it's warm!

300
00:29:09,321 --> 00:29:11,121
Let's go ぱ ぴ ぷ ぺ ポ〜ン!
Let's go! Pa, pi, pu, pe, pop!

301
00:29:11,121 --> 00:29:12,821
人生万歳!
Hurrah for life!

302
00:29:12,821 --> 00:29:14,521
この先10年安態〜
Set for the next 10 years~

303
00:29:14,521 --> 00:29:16,121
盛れてバズったらはんぱな〜い
If we look cute and go viral, it'll be crazy!

304
00:29:16,121 --> 00:29:20,321
Let's go ぱ ぴ ぷ ぺ ポ〜ン!
Let's go! Pa, pi, pu, pe, pop!

305
00:29:20,321 --> 00:29:21,621
ぴゅんぴゅんです
Pyun pyun!

306
00:29:21,621 --> 00:29:22,821
ろんろんです
Ron ron!

307
00:29:22,821 --> 00:29:24,321
はっぴーです
Happy!

308
00:29:24,321 --> 00:29:27,321
問題な〜いっす 半端な〜いっす ディスコティックなバンビーナ
